@end deffn
@anchor{Function sb-fiber fiber-pinned-p}
@ffindex @sortas{fiber-pinned-p sb-fiber} fiber-pinned-p [sb-fiber]
@deffn{Function} sb-fiber:fiber-pinned-p fiber
Return @code{t} if @code{fiber}'s pin count is greater than zero. @code{switch-fiber}
will only suspend a fiber with a pin count of zero.
